### 14\. Master V7 development directive

# AETHWYRD — UPGRADE V7
## ADVANCED EXPLORATION, DUNGEONS, ARCHAEOLOGY & ANCIENT CIVILIZATIONS

### PRIMARY OBJECTIVE

Expand Aethwyrd into a rich single-player exploration experience featuring sophisticated dungeons, environmental puzzles, ancient civilizations, archaeological discoveries, hidden locations, underground ecosystems, and meaningful secrets.

This is strictly a SINGLE-PLAYER upgrade.

Do not introduce multiplayer, online services, guild systems, matchmaking, PvP, or player-to-player trading.

Preserve existing working systems and expand them.

### 1. PROJECT DISCOVERY

- Inspect the existing world and exploration architecture.
- Identify current dungeon, quest, interaction, inventory, and world-state systems.
- Reuse existing functionality wherever possible.
- Document dependencies.
- Create an implementation roadmap before major changes.

