### FINAL EXPECTATION

Deliver a cohesive single-player Aethwyrd V7 exploration expansion.

The world should reward curiosity, observation, experimentation, and discovery.

Every major dungeon should feel memorable. Every civilization should have a distinct history. Every major discovery should contribute something meaningful to the player's understanding of Aethwyrd.

Do not add multiplayer functionality under any circumstances.

My recommendation: Make V7's signature feature the Ancient Dungeon & Discovery System. I would rather have 10 enormous, handcrafted, mysterious dungeons with interconnected secrets than 100 repetitive procedural caves.

V7 should make players want to explore every corner of Aethwyrd because they genuinely don't know what they might discover.
